# Plugins

- New source types = plugins only; never change crawler core for a new connector
- Each plugin: `plugin.json` + ESM `createPlugin()` (see `docs/PLUGIN_SDK.md`)
- No direct database access from plugins
- Match `metadata.pluginType` to Admin `Source.pluginType`
- After changes: `npm run verify:plugins`
- Worked example: `docs/PLUGIN_EXAMPLE.md` (`plugins/html`)
